@startuml
left to right direction

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam dpi 150

hide circle
hide empty members

class Refactoring
class Transformation

class RenameMethodRefactoring
class RenameMethodTransformation

class ChangeSignatureRefactoring
class ChangeSignatureTransformation
class ParameterTransformation

class PendingChanges

Transformation <|-- Refactoring
Refactoring -right-> Transformation : decorates

Refactoring <|-- RenameMethodRefactoring
Refactoring <|-- ChangeSignatureRefactoring

Transformation <|-- RenameMethodTransformation
Transformation <|-- ChangeSignatureTransformation
Transformation <|-- ParameterTransformation

ChangeSignatureTransformation o-- "ordered" ParameterTransformation : children
ChangeSignatureTransformation --> PendingChanges
ParameterTransformation --> PendingChanges : reads

@enduml
